direction: right
runner: "Runner / explicit caller limit\nOnline CPU discovery\nGERBIL_BUILD_CORES before Bazel"
provider: "Existing Bazel native provider\nPreserve declared capacity"
sdk: "Actual SDK handoff check\nstd/make frontend = compiler backend\nMissing / mismatched declaration refuses"
source: "Fresh prefix / source-only acquisition\nExisting native pin owner\n180 seconds / no tag or manifest"
compile: "Native SDK install + complete POO build\n180 seconds / 2 GiB per Scheme process\nNo restored binary products"
ci: "Aitia complete CI\nSemantic / recovery / ABI / Python / replay"
result: "Separate receipts\nSource acquisition + compilation latency\nFull CI remains an independent gate"
runner -> provider -> sdk -> source -> compile -> ci
source -> result
compile -> result
ci -> result
